olor:rgb(75,82,91);\">是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\" style=\"width:1.06667rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(0,182,79);vertical-align:middle;\"></label></span><div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);height:32px;\"><label style=\"\">目录颜色：</label><div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"width:0.53333rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(102,102,102);\"></div></div><button class=\"del-catalog-btn\" style=\"background:rgb(0,182,79);color:rgb(255,255,255);width:1.06667rem;height:0.64rem;\">删除</button></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">1.T技能5体流血+伤害共、振</span>（伤害非常高，不带解debuff的角色根本无法活命，因此<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(208, 8, 8);\">芙蕾雅+牡丹组合几乎是必备的</span>）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.3体高攻-40%攻击力</span>，这个很烦人，因为会影响到你的Buff分配，开局刀基本是必吃这个减攻的，一旦吃到减攻，后面很多Buff都会套歪，所以刀的温泉需要尽可能高，且</span><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 8, 8); font-weight: bold;\">必要时候需要凹开局</span>（减攻没打中或者牡丹先手套无敌）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3.乱舞之刃</span>，又是一重Dot，还附带破防效果，生存压力非常大。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4.DS加速</span>，如果队伍内没有解buff角色和退DS条角色，那么让亚里亚开出DS直接毁天灭地<span style=\"color: rgb(208, 8, 8); font-weight: bold;\">（甜甜圈T、老板娘S即可解决）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">5.超高的物理防御</span>，对人偶练度有需求</div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">对于<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636710038798_99018374.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold; width: 64px; height: 64px;\">镰刀人偶，<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(208, 8, 8);\">有硬性的练度需求，至少达到20级</span>，否则需要你其他地方全部拉满配置才能过。并且，镰刀人偶的等级需求和你的整体配置成反比，刀的石头，温泉越拉跨，需要的镰刀等级越高，简单来说，只要你对自己的配置没有自信，就无脑拉镰刀人偶的等级，拉到50-60级都不为过。</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:1px1px0.13333rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);height:0.90667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:0.32rem;\"><span class=\"text\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);width:auto;\"></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"角色替换思路\" style=\"width:4rem;background:rgb(255,255,255);height:0.64rem;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);\">是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\" style=\"width:1.06667rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(75,82,91);vertical-align:middle;\"></label></span><div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);height:32px;\"><label style=\"\">目录颜色：</label><div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"width:0.53333rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(102,102,102);\"></div></div><button class=\"del-catalog-btn\" style=\"background:rgb(0,182,79);color:rgb(255,255,255);width:1.06667rem;height:0.64rem;\">删除</button></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin