, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,0);\">必备的破防组合，</span>其中</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(201,0,0);\">拉姆至少点火6星</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，泽卡提不需要点火。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(208, 8, 8);\">镰刀人偶等级≥20级，上不封顶</span></div></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">如果没有泽卡提，则使用<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1607677056839_7406485.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;\">代替（</span><span style=\"color:rgb(201,0,0);\">至少点火3星</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，且负作用很大，尽量别用他）</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><br></div></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:1px1px0.13333rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);height:0.90667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:0.32rem;\"><span class=\"text\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);width:auto;\"></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"亚里亚专用对策小组\" style=\"width:4rem;background:rgb(255,255,255);height:0.64rem;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);\">是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\" style=\"width:1.06667rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(0,182,79);vertical-align:middle;\"></label></span><div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);height:32px;\"><label style=\"\">目录颜色：</label><div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"width:0.53333rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(102,102,102);\"></div></div><button class=\"del-catalog-btn\" style=\"background:rg